        {
            "label": "C32-G-sort-comparator-past-int-range",
            "php": "usort([3, 1, 2]) and (new Collection([3, 1, 2]))->sort() with a comparator answering ($a <=> $b) * 1e19, which the int cast wraps to the opposite sign, and usort() with one answering ($a <=> $b) * 2**64, which it wraps to 0",
            "value": {
